{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "027yuk_403_2_4_027_03_09_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:3f018918441a9c1974ce03471827f597e40b2ef302168c87d7bb27c39378a3e4",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:027yuk_403_2_4_027_03_09_b:2_4_027_03_09_b:cmd-000007:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:646f1b991276553482d6df4b3668484e549173691fd260961bffd0baa9ffd3ef",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，辛苦啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:027yuk_403_2_4_027_03_09_b:2_4_027_03_09_b:cmd-000009:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d667de65043678d0031529a12b583a2c0e485fecbc4759b265b9abe6d8b45609",
      "text": "舞台那边的彩排结束了，\n我现在转场去忘年会的演播室。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:027yuk_403_2_4_027_03_09_b:2_4_027_03_09_b:cmd-000011:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ae665caac638fa507c958b07955a0d2b82ff4795d00abb9d43d5a051d6a126e",
      "text": "忘年会的演播室是复古又别致的氛围，\n而演出用的舞台则非常华丽呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:027yuk_403_2_4_027_03_09_b:2_4_027_03_09_b:cmd-000013:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f6b1f1a7f40a06127bb45ea8671ad57db8e83a6493ab93498e6e6ebfd8b14218",
      "text": "距离忘年会的彩排开始好像还有点时间，\n暂时先待命就可以了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:027yuk_403_2_4_027_03_09_b:2_4_027_03_09_b:cmd-000015:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e4511c79dd301bd751212ca916d4ecb6803d0f2fe2fe7f710a166e18d934922",
      "text": "没问题的",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:027yuk_403_2_4_027_03_09_b:2_4_027_03_09_b:cmd-000016:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4a40c036a20c60ff3dfded7b0133a719fdacc545325c6be24b848cd39b8110d",
      "text": "到时间了\n会去叫大家的",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:027yuk_403_2_4_027_03_09_b:2_4_027_03_09_b:cmd-000019:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d5f4d2ba09088d600c02652cda3b15ac6362e8f5ccb38b562eaf1bf75685e429",
      "text": "知道了。我也转告大家一声。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:027yuk_403_2_4_027_03_09_b:2_4_027_03_09_b:cmd-000021:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0c045d8235caf6161c66946852cc3b1938d26883227f86a1dbd01041dd00560",
      "text": "……话虽如此，看着这个布景，\n真让人深切地感受到今年又要结束了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:027yuk_403_2_4_027_03_09_b:2_4_027_03_09_b:cmd-000023:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e99f22387778fbb4e933de046ed154dda5807edf67ec9e88d6b953286875b1d4",
      "text": "这一年里经历过的事，第一次见到的风景。\n回想起了好多好多啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:027yuk_403_2_4_027_03_09_b:2_4_027_03_09_b:cmd-000025:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7c73dbe8f1053baf82431fb0553e8387bd14374bb175254d0a8811ed7a8e9e0",
      "text": "哎呀，明明马上就要开始跨年直播了，\n现在就沉浸在感伤里还太早了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:027yuk_403_2_4_027_03_09_b:2_4_027_03_09_b:cmd-000027:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9a64bbe8ac048512379d6897a8af107ebae5df32c95766570d1e0f14368f1fc",
      "text": "直到最后一刻也不能松懈，\n我也要好好把气氛炒热起来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:027yuk_403_2_4_027_03_09_b:2_4_027_03_09_b:cmd-000029:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a200ce7ca3078a7358278e3767199385362a324ed8df60802012383e3c75c39",
      "text": "那么，我们先在休息室里待命啦。\n待会儿见。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
